rms this at “The Trail from Galatz”.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000}],"characterGoals":[{"id":"dracula-goal-1","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","characterId":"dracula-char-jonathan","startEventId":"dracula-event-1","endEventId":"dracula-event-12","type":"want","text":"Escape Castle Dracula and preserve evidence of what happened.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-goal-2","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","characterId":"dracula-char-dracula","startEventId":"dracula-event-1","endEventId":"dracula-event-82","type":"want","text":"Establish secure refuges in England, feed, and return to Transylvania when exposed.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-goal-3","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","characterId":"dracula-char-mina","startEventId":"dracula-event-13","endEventId":"dracula-event-84","type":"need","text":"Protect the people she loves by organizing truthful, shared records.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-goal-4","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","characterId":"dracula-char-seward","startEventId":"dracula-event-14","endEventId":"dracula-event-84","type":"need","text":"Move beyond clinical certainty and act on evidence that contradicts his worldview.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-goal-5","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","characterId":"dracula-char-van-helsing","startEventId":"dracula-event-29","endEventId":"dracula-event-84","type":"want","text":"Identify, contain, and destroy Dracula while saving those he has marked.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-goal-6","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","characterId":"dracula-char-arthur","startEventId":"dracula-event-13","endEventId":"dracula-event-84","type":"want","text":"Protect Lucy, then help release her and avenge her death.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-goal-7","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","characterId":"dracula-char-quincey","startEventId":"dracula-event-15","endEventId":"dracula-event-83","type":"want","text":"Stand by his friends and stop Dracula, regardless of personal cost.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-goal-8","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","characterId":"dracula-char-renfield","startEventId":"dracula-event-14","endEventId":"dracula-event-67","type":"need","text":"Escape the master he worshipped and prevent Mina from being harmed.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000}],"sceneTexts":[],"plotThreads":[{"id":"dracula-thread-migration","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Dracula Moves West","color":"#8f1d2c","description":"The Count prepares, executes, and later reverses his migration between Transylvania and England.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-thread-harker","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Jonathan’s Captivity and Recovery","color":"#8a6f45","description":"Jonathan survives the castle, recovers, and returns as an active hunter.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-thread-lucy","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Lucy’s Illness and Undeath","color":"#c8768b","description":"Sleepwalking, repeated attacks, failed treatments, death, and release from undeath.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-thread-renfield","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Renfield and the Coming Master","color":"#70835d","description":"Renfield’s appetites and loyalties track Dracula’s proximity.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-thread-archive","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"The Documentary Archive","color":"#6e7fa5","description":"Journals, letters, logs, clippings, and phonograph records become a shared instrument of action.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-thread-earth","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"The Boxes of Earth","color":"#72533e","description":"The hunters trace, count, sterilize, and pursue Dracula’s portable refuges.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-thread-rules","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Learning the Vampire’s Rules","color":"#9e875b","description":"Evidence and folklore gradually establish Dracula’s powers, needs, and limits.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-thread-mina","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Mina’s Contamination and Bond","color":"#7f5a78","description":"Dracula’s attack creates a psychic link that threatens and assists the hunters.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-thread-hunt","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"The Hunt for Dracula","color":"#a64d3d","description":"The coalition searches London and races to Transylvania before sunset.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000}],"motifs":[{"id":"dracula-motif-blood","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Blood","color":"#9c1f2e","description":"Life, kinship, medical exchange, predation, and spiritual contamination.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-motif-thresholds","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Thresholds and Invitation","color":"#8d775b","description":"Doors, windows, borders, and the permission required to cross them.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-motif-documents","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Documents and Modern Media","color":"#69819b","description":"Writing, shorthand, typewriting, telegrams, newspapers, and phonographs.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-motif-mist","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Mist, Storm, and Darkness","color":"#68727b","description":"Weather and obscurity that conceal Dracula’s movements.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-motif-sacred","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Sacred and Profane","color":"#c2a86b","description":"Consecrated objects confront corrupted bodies and spaces.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-motif-counting","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Counting and Accounting","color":"#7f6d55","description":"Days, boxes, transfusions, routes, and evidence are made actionable through exact records.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000},{"id":"dracula-motif-animals","worldId":"dracula-1897-world","name":"Animals and Appetite","color":"#74805d","description":"Wolves, bats, rats, flies, spiders, and consuming hunger.","createdAt":1785499200000,"updatedAt":1785499200000}],"continuitySuppressions":[],"writingLogs":[],"sceneRevisions":[]}